From a16e176d8cc94ee2d1b8357814f00434b0357673 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: alois <luong.alois@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 11:25:26 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 01/11] Audit fixes 2026-08-17: stale-resume reset, anchor
 deadbands, alpha rebalance, pilot height, waist unlock restore

- RC3: reset finite-diff velocity state on first fresh reference after a hold
- RC6: anchor velocity deadbands (0.08 m/s lin, 0.12 rad/s yaw), sim+real paths
- RC2: smoothing alphas 0.35/0.25 -> 0.6/0.5 (sim-verified: no fall, RMS at
  baseline, lag 40->20 ms)
- pilot height 1.74 m
- waist_pitch action_scale restored 0.0 -> 0.4386 (root cause was the G1
  waist LOCK: app config + fastener screws from previous devs, now removed)

Rollback: git checkout master -- <file>, or action_scale[14]=0.0 for the
waist alone.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
